# Claude Code working files.
#
# Everything under .claude/ is ignored EXCEPT the vault's shared tooling:
# settings.json and the hooks that back the "archive before editing" rule.
#
# Why the exception: a blanket `.claude/` rule is how the original
# archive-before-edit hook was lost. The vault was copied here from
# C:\Users\lijumba\... without its .claude/ folder, CLAUDE.md went on claiming
# the hook existed, and nothing was archived. Keeping the hook tracked means it
# travels with the vault. See 01 Projects/CLAUDE.md.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/

# Machine-local overrides and session scratch stay out of the repo.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Hook state file (regenerated automatically).
01 Projects/Kalemie/07 Narrative Craft/.last-archived

# Editor lock/temp files (Word, Obsidian plugins).
~$*

# Obsidian UI state. Rewritten every time a pane is moved, so it shows up
# dirty constantly and its diffs say nothing about the writing.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json

# Vendored plugin bundles — ~21 MB of third-party build output that dwarfs the
# notes themselves. Reinstallable from Obsidian's community plugin browser.
# Each plugin's own data.json IS tracked, so settings still travel with the vault.
.obsidian/plugins/*/main.js
.obsidian/plugins/*/styles.css
.obsidian/plugins/*/manifest.json

# Generated submission artifacts — rebuildable from the markdown source.
# Kept out of git so story prose is never pushed as a binary to a public remote.
01 Projects/Kalemie/10 Prize Campaign/11 Submission Pack/*.docx
01 Projects/Kalemie/10 Prize Campaign/11 Submission Pack/*.pdf
.obsidian/graph.json

# Compiled app binaries — rebuildable from the app-android source beside them.
# Same reason as the submission artifacts: no opaque binaries on a public remote.
*.apk
# Exception, on the user's explicit instruction 2026-08-11: the MNADA demo build is
# tracked so it can be downloaded and sideloaded without a toolchain. It is signed
# with the Android debug key and carries no story prose.
!01 Projects/Ventures/09 Mnada/mnada-demo-*.apk

# Other authors' stories held in full for study. Published works, copyright theirs.
# Tracked on the user's explicit instruction 2026-07-31: these are published and
# publicly readable (Granta / Commonwealth Foundation). Copyright remains the authors'.